Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.72,0:03:17.84,PS,,0,0,0,,冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.81,0:04:55.57,PS,,0,0,0,,死寂
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.27,0:05:35.77,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.2\fay-0.03\fs50\b1\fsp40\an5\bord0\c&H2C2D3B&\frz340.8\pos(970.4,616)}签到表
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.93,0:08:56.64,PS,,0,0,0,,嘎吱嘎吱嘎吱\N你在这里啊—
